      "html": "<ul><li>From the Betta unimaculata complex.</li><li>IUCN Red List: N/A</li><li>Wild-caught Betta ocellata from Malinau.</li><li>Maximum size: 3+ inches (about 7.6 cm).</li><li>Breeding: Mouthbrooder.</li></ul>"
